From 8024fabca5c78e212368f9a26847620d594899cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:57:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sessions): say which machine holds a chat that is open
 somewhere else [daveey]

Leases now record the machine whose window/terminal holds the chat (the SSH
Desktop client via HERMES_DESKTOP_CLIENT_HOST, else this host). The refusal and
takeover Details line names it, and the SESSION_NOT_OWNED card body reads
'This chat is open in Hermes desktop on <host> (opened 4m ago)'.
